    "there was an issue importing this modpack.\n\nthe required resources were unobtainable and will require manual installation.": "Tämän modipaketin tuonnissa ilmeni ongelma.\n\nTarvittavia resursseja ei saatu, joten ne on asennettava manuaalisesti.",
